  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I version my projects as MODEL_NAME/VERSION_NUMBER/PURPOSE, so you have things like Kova/1/Blender or Kova/1/VRChat. Makes automated backups and keeping resources in sync a lot easier. In Unity, this is a small annoyance, because you end up with every project listed as VRChat. No big deal, since I can at least see the path. But, in VCC, everything is simply VRChat.\nDoing an O(n) search through my projects isn't too appealing. Could we get the absolute path as a sub-title? Alternatively, a configurable title?",
